  "body": "It would be nice if in addition to `vendorId` and `productId`, we just had `vendor` and `product`. The UA could just hold a list of id's like: \n\nhttp://www.linux-usb.org/usb.ids\n\nThat list could be kept evergreen by implementers. \n",
